OL,3,GNEWSAFurther walkout planned by NI
OL,4,Adoctors as strike ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 24-hour strike by resident doctors in
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland held as part of an
OL,8,Fongoing dispute over pay has ended, but
OL,9,Ffresh action will begin on Monday.
OL,11,FConsultants and specialist doctors will
OL,12,Fbegin a separate 24-hour strike
OL,13,Ffollowing the weekend, as part of the
OL,14,Fsame dispute.
OL,16,FThe British Medical Association (BMA)
OL,17,Frejected a recommended 3.5% pay rise
OL,18,Fand wants to restore the value of
OL,19,Fdoctors' pay to 2008 levels.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
