OL,3,GNEWSAFurther walkout planned by NI
OL,4,Adoctors as strike ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth Minister Robbie Butler said he
OL,7,Fhad accepted the recommended rise but
OL,8,Fcould not implement it without
OL,9,Fsufficient funding for his department.
